Package: IRdag
Type: Package
Title: R Kernel for Jupyter with the jupyter-dag Protocol Additions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Max", "Klein", email = "telamonian@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The IRkernel R kernel plus the four jupyter-dag kernel-protocol additions:
    static cell analysis ('analyze_request'), namespace delete and set on 'execute_request',
    and a namespace delta on every 'execute_reply', advertised as JEP 92 supported features.
    The same payloads are also served over the 'jupyter-dag' comm target.
